# Working files behind ONE run, not artefacts of it.  This arm's committed
# outputs are models/*.xml (the scenes, regenerated from rungs.py) and
# results/*.json (the reports); everything below is intermediate state that a
# multi-run cell (CONTRACT.md amendment A) writes on its way to one of those.
#
#   results/cells/         one dir per rung per `python run.py`, holding rung
#                          9's per-replica run records -- each replica is a
#                          separate interpreter and hands its measurement back
#                          through a file, so the files exist for the length of
#                          the cell and are worth keeping only to debug one.
#   results/rung18*/       rung 18's per-cell output and the R5 defaults sweep,
#                          which is explicitly NOT a ladder row.
results/cells/
results/rung18/
results/rung18_sweep/
